cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it and the FracAtlas dataset."
title: "OrthoVision: Orthopedic X-ray Fracture Detection and Explainable Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A course research prototype that detects suspected fracture regions on
  musculoskeletal radiographs with YOLO11 detectors fine-tuned on FracAtlas,
  visualises feature-attribution maps (Eigen-CAM / Grad-CAM), and reports
  reproducible test-set metrics, model-size / threshold / enhancement
  comparisons, error cases and image-degradation sensitivity. Not for clinical use.
authors:
